#: scenario7:scenario7_90291295_72F6_4C51_BFC6_381BD6CEF353
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c996901efdb45ccde1d6ac2f6bbf605339ab3fbaae29d8f64bcf5f67d135a925
