msgid "⟪k:0⟫This isn’t how I wanted it to happen."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Não era assim que eu queria que acontecesse."

#: scenario7:scenario7_F4B7AAC7_8F40_40E8_B4DC_DAA38BFB6CEF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 142ba36be27faff06cfabe26bb03fbaf6a93cb3e2e0a5145d119210e269bddd3
