msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F4B7AAC7_8F40_40E8_B4DC_DAA38BFB6CEF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Not coming from my own mouth, but being laid bare for all to see without my consent."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Não vindo da minha própria boca, mas sendo exposto para todos verem sem meu consentimento."

#: scenario7:scenario7_88540E0B_4C1F_4535_B178_8FF75C778400
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a40683c40db6505244bdb391daad0875d0b9a63d082520b87e8a441bf511f910
#. default-sha256: b266e564c55d43811aafc67c6cd72a3e1867f990a7e083f775cf04d8815da702
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_88540E0B_4C1F_4535_B178_8FF75C778400"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫That wasn’t how I wanted her to find out about my secret.⟪k:1⟫About my shameful history."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Não era assim que eu queria que ela descobrisse meu segredo.⟪k:1⟫Sobre minha história "
"vergonhosa."

#: scenario7:scenario7_011499B5_A734_4A7F_BADA_EECA71EE1258
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9e91401fafd642130101196975090fa62fa760e41fe34e1b4997564fb54c8844
#. default-sha256: e89bf7a7f148c657712e538c936810d258574dae0218862d121fb83f1e966ae0
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_011499B5_A734_4A7F_BADA_EECA71EE1258"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I warned you, my dear.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I told you you didn’t want to reclaim your old self."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu avisei você, meu querido.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Eu disse que você não queria recuperar seu antigo eu."

#: scenario7:scenario7_DF7DD3A0_BC0F_4C5C_B3F1_B44B778C1EB2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 03bf5dd175dde37456d46a57601a4b3103db0be1d20604abfcb64a1ae9d92137
#. default-sha256: 09ea9740643041143475c26d5277c751f63e98baecec5d29d6f2805f846f21b8
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_DF7DD3A0_BC0F_4C5C_B3F1_B44B778C1EB2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫If you had simply let it be, you wouldn’t be here now, forced to relive it all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Se você tivesse simplesmente deixado acontecer, não estaria aqui agora, forçado a reviver "
"tudo."

#: scenario7:scenario7_26AA5245_B7EF_4A45_A834_0B33AE52C6D2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8febea726c97b2d621b621d4fca3e777e9d744732118748c77b9be0a6f688e0a
#. default-sha256: 4d7de4c43c9f2db879f4ce64002958987990b4e1f9c37a334db673c190c72b49
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_26AA5245_B7EF_4A45_A834_0B33AE52C6D2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Now do you understand?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The tale I spun behind the fourth door...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫was as "
"much for you as it was for her."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Agora entende?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫A história que contei atrás da quarta porta...⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫era tanto "
"para você quanto para ela."

#: scenario7:scenario7_549F9556_6FFA_41FE_A2D5_02D9825633E8
