#: scenario7:scenario7_782DC1D8_EFC8_40C7_A723_4689DB8A74F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e825658b2ad198f7ed51e2a3221c3a096beaf6cf0acbae4c19ef72a1c134f02
