msgstr "⟪k:0⟫e então morreu nos braços da tragédia."

#: scenario7:scenario7_6A27B7F1_BF1F_48E8_9185_3B6D50AA5242
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: f860882aa7f44677cbb95c97e7d7a5367642e948ae86129e85c2cfaeeda7c21f
