msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫All the windows were either shuttered or boarded, encasing the house in darkness. "
"⟪k:3⟫In a way, it felt like all I had done was move from one prison to a much larger one."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Todas as janelas estavam fechadas ou com tábuas, envolvendo a casa na escuridão. "
"⟪k:3⟫De certa forma, parecia que tudo o que eu tinha feito era mudar de prisão para uma muito "
"maior."

#: scenario7:scenario7_07AD7681_D31A_46C2_A2B1_605FBAB4690C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
