msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Briefly, I thought they had possibly been sealed to keep anyone from seeing me inside, but "
"my coming here was a very recent development."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Por um momento, pensei que elas possivelmente tivessem sido fechadas para impedir que alguém "
"me visse lá dentro, mas minha vinda para cá era um desenrolar muito recente."

