msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quite the piece of property my father had found himself with.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I wondered if he had "
"been swindled by its previous owner."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Que bela propriedade meu pai tinha encontrado.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Me perguntei se ele havia sido "
"enganado pelo dono anterior."

